  "title": "Television: James Paul McCartney | 1973",
  "date": "1973-03-17",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>A rehearsal for the television special <em>James Paul McCartney</em> took place on 17 March 1973 at Elstree Studios. <span id=\"more-133425\"></span></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_07/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-133387\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iODc2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDg3NiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"133387\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_07/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_07.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1200,1314\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_07-877x960.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_07-877x960.jpg\" alt=\"James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" width=\"800\" height=\"876\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-133387\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_07-877x960.jpg 877w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_07-530x580.jpg 530w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_07-183x200.jpg 183w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_07-768x841.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_07.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>The rehearsal came the day before Wings performed in the studios before an audience of fans.</p><p>Produced by ATV, <em>James Paul McCartney</em> was first broadcast on 16 April 1973 in the USA, and 10 May in the UK. It was released on DVD as part of the super deluxe reissue of in <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/albums/red-rose-speedway/\"><em>Red Rose Speedway</em></a> December 2018.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/03/17/television-james-paul-mccartney-6/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-133425 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Wings in the James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-580x577.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-960x955.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-768x764.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01-1536x1528.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01.jpg 1600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"133381\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/73-james-paul-mccartney_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/73-james-paul-mccartney_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1592\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Wings in the James Paul McCartney TV special, 1973\" 